hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2966","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar, narrated to us Yahya, narrated to us Thawr, on the authority of Rāshid ibn Saʿd, on the authority of ʿAbdullāh ibn Luḥayy, on the authority of ʿAbdullāh ibn Qurṭ, who said:\n\nThe Messenger of Allāh (ﷺ) said, \The greatest days with Allāh are the Day of Sacrifice (Yawm al-Naḥr)"","" then the Day of Rest (Yawm al-Qarr).\""\n\nCHAPTER:"""""
